.TH AVR\-TESTS 1 "" "avr 0.5.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-tests \- Read a job's tests, timings and recorded failure messages.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr tests
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read a job's tests, timings and recorded failure messages.
.PP
Use avr tests JOB (or avr tests list JOB). JOB is an Avrea job ID (job- or awj-) from avr job list.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
list
Read the latest confirmed execution of JOB, including repeated tests.
.TP
view
Read one exact test result using its result_id from avr tests JOB.
